:''Not to be confused with [[Fallen Bear]].''
'''Demon Teacher Bear''' (鬼化クマ先生, ''Onika Kuma-sensei'', '''Demonized Teacher Bear''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Demon Teacher Bear
|image = E 766.png
|first appearance = [[Rising Sun]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
Compared to [[Teacher Bear]], Demon Teacher Bear has 50 times the health, only 3 times the attack power, but has less knockbacks at only 2, faster attack frequency and doubled move speed. They also get the ability to [[Savage Blow]] at a 20% chance and a 50% chance to [[Weaken]] for 4 seconds. Overall, this armed fellow can just be considered to be a souped-up Teacher Bear.

==Strategy==
Prioritize using units with more than 350 range like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|any]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dragon]] [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|variant]], and you can whittle their health down as you keep them at bay with good meatshielding. If you have [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless units]], they can be used to lend multiple hands to kill this creature. Stand-out choices include [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]], [[Brainwashed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Wall Cat]], [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Vendor Cat and Kitten]], [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]], and any Anti-Traitless [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]]/[[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] you might have.

